	"Description": "Editor mode + runtime framework for building, wiring up and testing machine-learning models (ONNX, via Unreal's Neural Network Engine) directly against actors and levels. Ships with two ready-to-use examples: ML-driven procedural animation and ML-driven procedural environment generation, plus a generic 'ML Brain' component and Blueprint function library for any other use case (NPC behaviour, dynamic difficulty, anomaly/cheat detection, etc.).",
